        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSWT, Solid Brass Windsor Finial</b>\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Windsor finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll Deltana decorative finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with  <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinges\"><b>Deltana Solid Brass Hinges</b></a> (except <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"> 6\" x 6\" Brass Hinge</a>).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Windsor Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread: 8mm x 1.25mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana PVD Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Windsor Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSWT",
                "description": "Deltana DSWT Windsor Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Windsor cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in 12 finishes.",
                "keywords": "DEL-DSWT Windsor Style Brass Hinge Tips, Deltana DSWT3 Windsor Tip, hinge brass tips, hinge brass finials, Windsor Tip Solid Brass hinge Finials, DEL-DSWT26D, DEL-DSWT26, DEL-DSWT10B, DEL-DSWT14, DEL-DSWT15, DEL-DSWT15A, DEL-DSWT19, DEL-DSWT3, DEL-DSWT3-UNL, DEL-DSWT4, DEL-DSWT5, DEL-CWT1,"
